.SS Abstract
These macros execute the \f[CR]CPUID\f[R] instruction and return the
values stored in the CPU registers after execution.
.PP
\f[CR]CPUID\f[R] is used to query processor information such as vendor
ID, feature flags, supported instruction sets, cache details, and
extended processor capabilities.
.PP
The requested information is selected using the \f[B]leaf value\f[R],
which is placed in the \f[CR]EAX\f[R] register before executing
\f[CR]CPUID\f[R].
